# No Browser Unless Asked

- Do NOT open the browser or take screenshots unless the user explicitly asks you to.
- This includes refactoring tasks, styling changes, bug fixes, and any code edits — never auto-open the browser to "verify" or "preview".
- Browser automation is expensive in tokens. Only use it when the user says something like "open the browser", "check in the browser", or "take a screenshot".
